        {
          "event_type": "nothing",
          "message": "[bold]You arrive at Corsair's Rest.[/bold]\n\nThe port appears through a golden haze \u2014 sun-warmed stone, terracotta roofs, and the sound of harbor life carrying across calm water. Spring arrivals in the Mediterranean feel like coming home, even when you've never been here before.\n\nShips anchor in the hidden cove with no flags flying. A boy in a rowboat approaches to collect the docking fee \u2014 payable in silver, no questions.\n\n[bold]One-Eye Basso:[/bold] \"...Clear behind you. Come in. Kill your running lights before the bend.\"\n\n[dim]Landmark: The Cliff Tavern \u2014 carved into the rock face, visible only from the sea.[/dim]\n[dim]Custom: No names. Every captain here is 'friend' until proven otherwise.[/dim]",
